WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.670
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:32.210 --> 00:01:34.490
The last round of the Banquet Cuisine Competition.

00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:38.500
This is also a competition for Shaoan
who's the first student

00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:40.450
of my mother and me to end the hatred.

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:42.680
And the selected theme

00:01:42.730 --> 00:01:44.970
is tofu which is the same as
the competition of Chrysanthemum Tower.

00:01:44.970 --> 00:01:45.850
(Tofu)

00:01:45.850 --> 00:01:47.760
The review would start sixteen hours later.

00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:50.780
We started from making tofu with soybeans.

00:01:51.440 --> 00:01:51.990
However, at that time,

00:01:52.190 --> 00:01:53.470
my tofu

00:01:53.520 --> 00:01:54.540
was damaged by them.

00:01:58.120 --> 00:01:58.810
It must be Xiang En.

00:01:59.420 --> 00:02:00.830
Only people like Xiang En

00:02:00.890 --> 00:02:01.790
will do something like that.

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:04.480
Please find a solution, Mao.

00:02:05.380 --> 00:02:07.130
My father's life is in your hands now.

00:02:08.150 --> 00:02:09.460
I really should thank Xiang En.

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:10.930
Without her help,

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:12.120
I can't make this

00:02:12.170 --> 00:02:12.930
trans-century tofu dish.

00:02:14.850 --> 00:02:15.870
Mao's Real Ability!

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:17.870
Magical Panda Tofu

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:25.540
They're here.

00:02:31.280 --> 00:02:32.470
Judges are all here.

00:02:32.610 --> 00:02:33.970
It's almost the time.

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:36.070
They'll taste the dishes an hour later.

00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:39.990
I think both the contestants have already made tofu

00:02:40.090 --> 00:02:41.750
and they're cooking dishes now.

00:03:03.890 --> 00:03:06.500
I can't wait!

00:03:06.550 --> 00:03:07.990
Come on, Shaoan!

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:10.870
In the last round of the Banquet Cuisine Competition,

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:14.360
Shaoan showed up in the venue first.

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:23.190
Then Mao who's the youngest Super Chef in history

00:03:23.280 --> 00:03:26.020
also showed up in the venue.

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:29.590
We're counting on you, Mao!

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:30.870
Mao!

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:42.900
The destined competition of two chefs of Sichuan cuisine.

00:03:43.130 --> 00:03:45.030
Who on earth will win this competition?

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:50.440
I can't help trembling all over.

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:52.670
No matter what the ending will be,

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:53.590
we've already entered the final stage.

00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:55.870
It's the last competition between two \"generals\".

00:03:56.190 --> 00:03:58.160
The grudge between Mao and Shaoan,

00:03:58.560 --> 00:03:59.710
the legendary cookware,

00:03:59.980 --> 00:04:01.180
and the right to control Shanghai Cuisine Society.

00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:04.210
They all depend on the result of this round.

00:04:05.380 --> 00:04:06.170
Father.

00:04:08.040 --> 00:04:09.070
No matter how you struggle,

00:04:09.120 --> 00:04:10.420
I believe you cannot make

00:04:10.470 --> 00:04:11.470
a decent tofu dish.

00:04:12.290 --> 00:04:15.350
Let's start the countdown for the occupation of Shanghai.

00:04:16.370 --> 00:04:16.940
Mao,

00:04:17.470 --> 00:04:20.020
listen to your funeral music carefully.

00:04:20.450 --> 00:04:23.340
It's the Tofu Trio I'm going to play now.

00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:26.330
Tofu Trio?

00:04:27.180 --> 00:04:28.340
What's that?

00:04:29.150 --> 00:04:29.690
Take it to me.

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:40.600
Open up your eyes and listen carefully.

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:42.860
Be a whole-body listener.

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:46.410
This is the unique Tofu Trio.

00:05:05.060 --> 00:05:07.590
The tofu is so beautiful!

00:05:07.690 --> 00:05:08.560
It shines

00:05:08.680 --> 00:05:11.110
like the white marble.

00:05:11.650 --> 00:05:13.180
I used excellent soybeans

00:05:13.230 --> 00:05:15.950
and distilled water which has been filtered for a long time

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:18.220
to make the tender tofu with a super high purity.

00:05:22.450 --> 00:05:23.060
That is

00:05:24.570 --> 00:05:25.580
a bamboo kitchen knife!

00:05:29.530 --> 00:05:31.400
Pay attention to what I'm doing, Mao.

00:05:47.900 --> 00:05:48.910
It's so amazing!

00:05:49.090 --> 00:05:49.820
With Shaoan's excellent knife skill,

00:05:50.020 --> 00:05:50.960
this piece of perfect tofu

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:52.010
has been cut into

00:05:52.060 --> 00:05:54.150
regular small cubes instantly.

00:05:57.480 --> 00:05:58.080
Amazing!

00:05:58.160 --> 00:05:59.660
His knife skill is so amazing.

00:05:59.900 --> 00:06:01.400
Mao, you shouldn't say that.

00:06:01.480 --> 00:06:02.230
Gosh.

00:06:02.280 --> 00:06:04.630
His old problem occurs again now.

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:06.690
This guy is knowledgeable.

00:06:07.650 --> 00:06:09.910
The ratio of soybeans

00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:12.590
and water used for making tofu is 1:9.

00:06:12.670 --> 00:06:14.360
The tofu is very soft and fragile.

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:17.270
Once its shape is damaged,

00:06:17.320 --> 00:06:18.470
it tastes worse.

00:06:18.520 --> 00:06:19.790
I can't believe that he also knows it.

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:21.290
So guys, look.

00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:23.370
He cuts tofu

00:06:23.720 --> 00:06:24.470
into accurate cubes.

00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:26.200
This kind of superb skill has gone beyond the limit.

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:28.130
And to avoid the smell of the iron,

00:06:28.550 --> 00:06:29.980
he cuts the tofu with a bamboo kitchen knife.

00:06:30.340 --> 00:06:31.090
He's considerate over it.

00:06:32.840 --> 00:06:35.250
The real surprise is yet to come.

00:06:37.970 --> 00:06:39.650
Two kitchen knives?

00:06:43.200 --> 00:06:44.650
He generously shows us

00:06:44.690 --> 00:06:45.720
all of his superb skills.

00:06:45.770 --> 00:06:47.030
It seems that

00:06:47.070 --> 00:06:48.790
Shaoan's great enthusiasm can even evaporate his sweat.

00:06:48.900 --> 00:06:50.550
The whole venue is also filled with this heat power.

00:06:51.990 --> 00:06:52.860
So amazing.

00:06:53.190 --> 00:06:54.890
This is the chef's obsession with cooking.

00:06:55.630 --> 00:06:57.170
Mao can handle that, right?

00:07:00.580 --> 00:07:02.320
Mao.

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:03.050
Crap.

00:07:03.380 --> 00:07:04.490
Shaoan is

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:05.520
already on his mettle here.

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:06.140
He has begun to cook.

00:07:06.510 --> 00:07:08.320
Our tofu is not ready yet,

00:07:08.470 --> 00:07:10.260
so Mao can't start to cook.

00:07:10.510 --> 00:07:12.620
Crap. It's all that woman's fault.

00:07:15.370 --> 00:07:16.390
If she didn't

00:07:16.690 --> 00:07:18.970
sabotage our soybeans on purpose,

00:07:19.590 --> 00:07:21.850
Mao would be able to start cooking early.

00:07:24.180 --> 00:07:26.310
Look, Shaoan is...

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:27.940
Two pots!

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:29.960
You're so great, Shaoan!

00:07:31.690 --> 00:07:33.660
Control two pots at the same time.

00:07:34.170 --> 00:07:35.200
To chefs who study Chinese cuisine,

00:07:35.250 --> 00:07:36.400
which is known as the flame cuisine,

00:07:36.450 --> 00:07:38.010
this skill is one of the best skills.

00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:41.740
That's noodle.

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:43.380
Shaoan is cooking noodles.

00:07:43.470 --> 00:07:44.030
That means

00:07:44.190 --> 00:07:45.880
the other pot contains the filing.

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:48.250
He wants to make the Braised Noodles with Tofu.

00:07:49.070 --> 00:07:50.720
Soon you'll understand

00:07:50.980 --> 00:07:53.210
why I can surpass the cooking skills

00:07:53.260 --> 00:07:55.220
of Chef Pai who's called \"Fairy of Sichuan\".

00:08:03.070 --> 00:08:04.160
I'm done!

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:11.280
It looks great.

00:08:11.580 --> 00:08:12.590
It's wonderful.

00:08:12.870 --> 00:08:14.610
The crystalline shiny noodles,

00:08:14.750 --> 00:08:16.300
the aromatic auxiliary ingredients,

00:08:16.550 --> 00:08:18.340
and the tender white tofu which shines

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:19.720
like the diamond.

00:08:19.940 --> 00:08:22.540
Every of them is a nonesuch.

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:24.380
You can't know

00:08:24.430 --> 00:08:26.720
the real surprise until you taste my dish.

00:08:30.390 --> 00:08:31.080
Chef Xie,

00:08:31.180 --> 00:08:32.820
can I borrow your watch?

00:08:33.460 --> 00:08:35.650
They'll taste the dishes five minutes later.

00:08:36.300 --> 00:08:37.130
Even Shaoan

00:08:37.180 --> 00:08:38.710
was very careful when he cutting

00:08:38.810 --> 00:08:40.610
and cooking the tofu.

00:08:41.490 --> 00:08:42.560
There are only five minutes left.

00:08:42.610 --> 00:08:44.230
Mao can't make a dish.

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:45.300
Take your time.

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:46.850
How can I take my time?

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:47.900
It's reasonable.

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:49.520
The life of Sanjie's father

00:08:49.570 --> 00:08:50.620
all depends on Mao.

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:53.060
I believe Mao is also very clear about that.

00:08:53.400 --> 00:08:53.950
Look at him.

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:56.740
He's concentrating on it.

00:08:57.070 --> 00:08:58.300
It's obvious that he's absorbed in

00:08:58.350 --> 00:08:59.930
thinking about how to make a delicious tofu dish

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:01.500
Mao,

00:09:01.960 --> 00:09:03.950
you have an amazing countermeasure, right?

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:06.690
Can you make something that is better than Shaoan's dish?

00:09:08.530 --> 00:09:09.550
Sanjie,

00:09:09.670 --> 00:09:11.110
please trust Mao.

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:14.110
I believe my teacher can find a solution.

00:09:14.460 --> 00:09:16.560
He always can, right?

00:09:17.560 --> 00:09:18.180
Silang.

00:09:31.870 --> 00:09:32.730
If you want to quit,

00:09:32.780 --> 00:09:34.030
raise the white flag and surrender now, kid.

00:09:34.080 --> 00:09:35.040
Yes, just surrender.

00:09:36.780 --> 00:09:37.610
Surrender.

00:09:41.590 --> 00:09:42.630
There are only thirty seconds left.

00:09:43.900 --> 00:09:44.370
Silang,

00:09:44.420 --> 00:09:46.660
how can I trust him?

00:09:46.760 --> 00:09:48.090
I feel uncomfortable.

00:09:50.060 --> 00:09:50.570
Done.

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:52.300
Mao.

00:09:52.830 --> 00:09:54.090
Mao.

00:09:54.140 --> 00:09:56.170
It's late, Mao. It's too late.

00:09:56.490 --> 00:09:57.900
Even if you make the dish now,

00:09:57.950 --> 00:09:59.080
it doesn't help.

00:10:07.700 --> 00:10:09.620
Is he planning to...

00:10:24.190 --> 00:10:24.920
He also

00:10:25.070 --> 00:10:26.850
took the mold to the judges.

00:10:27.190 --> 00:10:28.420
No kidding. What is he doing?

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:29.330
What on earth does he want to do?

00:10:31.220 --> 00:10:32.140
What?

00:10:32.430 --> 00:10:34.980
What on earth is going on?

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:37.430
Why on earth is this youngest genius chef

00:10:37.480 --> 00:10:38.920
in history doing like that?

00:10:39.610 --> 00:10:40.500
It looks like he wants to use

00:10:40.550 --> 00:10:41.460
the new-made tofu

00:10:41.510 --> 00:10:42.770
to compete with Shaoan.

00:10:43.770 --> 00:10:45.540
I think he has no other choice.

00:10:45.890 --> 00:10:47.220
Only tofu.

00:10:47.320 --> 00:10:48.160
How can I comment on it?

00:10:48.900 --> 00:10:51.070
Besides, you even took the mold here.

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:53.170
It's so boring.

00:10:53.760 --> 00:10:55.330
I'll take the mold away now.

00:11:08.310 --> 00:11:08.990
This is...

00:11:21.130 --> 00:11:22.930
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:11:28.850 --> 00:11:29.720
It's so dazzling.

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:43.000
This is...

00:11:44.090 --> 00:11:44.840
It's really...

00:11:45.000 --> 00:11:46.800
What? How is this possible?

00:11:49.610 --> 00:11:52.060
The white and the black are spaced regularly.

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:54.360
Mao has made a

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:56.470
huge piece of two-colored tofu

00:11:56.620 --> 00:11:58.340
which is shiny, black and white.

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:01.130
What on earth is going on?

00:12:02.160 --> 00:12:02.700
What's going on?

00:12:02.940 --> 00:12:04.010
What's that tofu?

00:12:04.510 --> 00:12:05.230
What's that?

00:12:09.030 --> 00:12:10.450
Liu Maoxing's

00:12:10.630 --> 00:12:12.160
Magical Panda Tofu.

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:13.480
(Magical Panda Tofu)

00:12:13.480 --> 00:12:14.410
Magical...

00:12:14.560 --> 00:12:15.820
Panda Tofu?

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:17.270
The tofu is so weird.

00:12:18.260 --> 00:12:19.530
This is the most special tofu

00:12:19.580 --> 00:12:20.670
I've ever seen.

00:12:24.330 --> 00:12:25.850
When on earth did this kid

00:12:25.900 --> 00:12:26.350
make it?

00:12:26.810 --> 00:12:28.850
What kind of tofu is it?

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:29.950
No way.

00:12:30.260 --> 00:12:32.080
The tofu was as soft as water

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:34.040
when it was poured into the mold.

00:12:34.410 --> 00:12:35.850
Its color can't change

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:37.080
and it can't be layered.

00:12:39.800 --> 00:12:40.680
Don't worry.

00:12:41.010 --> 00:12:42.850
No matter it's layered or black and white,

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:44.970
it's still a piece of tofu.

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:46.500
You didn't cook it.

00:12:46.550 --> 00:12:47.970
You took out the ingredient directly.

00:12:48.350 --> 00:12:50.160
It's impossible for you to win, Mao.

00:12:52.010 --> 00:12:54.150
Shaoan and Liu Maoxing

00:12:54.230 --> 00:12:55.750
both made a dish in the limited time.

00:12:55.990 --> 00:12:58.610
Then the review of the last round of

00:12:58.610 --> 00:12:59.310
Then the review of the last round of
this Banquet Cuisine Competition

00:12:59.310 --> 00:12:59.360
Then the review of the last round of

00:12:59.360 --> 00:13:00.060
Then the review of the last round of
will start now.

00:13:00.060 --> 00:13:00.270
Then the review of the last round of

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:01.510
Wait.

00:13:03.990 --> 00:13:04.930
Hey. Kid,

00:13:05.540 --> 00:13:06.510
you can't

00:13:06.560 --> 00:13:07.930
just put a large piece of tofu

00:13:07.980 --> 00:13:09.290
in front of us anyway.

00:13:09.450 --> 00:13:10.090
You asked us to eat it.

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:11.140
But it's too rough.

00:13:11.630 --> 00:13:13.770
Yes. You should cut it for us at least.

00:13:14.210 --> 00:13:15.700
I don't need to do it.

00:13:16.110 --> 00:13:17.420
You don't need to cut it?

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:18.860
What do you mean, kid?

00:13:20.640 --> 00:13:22.720
It's not just a piece of tofu.

00:13:23.310 --> 00:13:24.440
It's a tofu dish.

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:25.620
Besides,

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:31.810
I'm going to perform magic tricks now.

00:13:51.170 --> 00:13:52.280
What?

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:57.800
The tofu he took it out of the mold just now

00:13:58.090 --> 00:13:59.130
has been cut into pieces.

00:13:59.500 --> 00:14:01.270
So... So amazing.

00:14:01.370 --> 00:14:02.880
It's really a great magic trick.

00:14:14.980 --> 00:14:15.810
It's the panda.

00:14:16.140 --> 00:14:17.920
Pandas are playing in the bamboo grove.

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:20.700
There is a red liquid under

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:22.660
the bamboo leaves of the plate!

00:14:27.990 --> 00:14:29.390
Liu Maoxing's

00:14:29.890 --> 00:14:32.360
Magical Panda Mapo is done!

00:14:32.360 --> 00:14:33.990
(Magical Panda Mapo)

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:37.000
What?

00:14:37.120 --> 00:14:39.520
It's the Mapo Tofu.

00:14:39.700 --> 00:14:41.120
But it's really exciting.

00:14:41.460 --> 00:14:42.750
When bamboo leaves fell down,

00:14:42.840 --> 00:14:44.510
the black and white tofu

00:14:44.630 --> 00:14:47.390
is like the panda who's playing in the bamboo grove.

00:14:48.310 --> 00:14:49.650
It's so cute!

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:51.240
It's a cute and interesting dish.

00:14:51.590 --> 00:14:52.500
When I look at this tofu,

00:14:52.720 --> 00:14:54.460
I feel like I'm in the hometown of the panda.

00:14:54.510 --> 00:14:57.090
It's Sichuan which is at the source of the Yangtze River.

00:14:57.570 --> 00:14:59.660
There is an inevitable bout of homesickness.

00:15:00.890 --> 00:15:02.770
Mao is so great!

00:15:02.820 --> 00:15:03.560
Magic trick.

00:15:03.680 --> 00:15:05.030
It's really a great trans-century magic trick.

00:15:05.110 --> 00:15:06.330
Good job, Mao!

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:12.930
What is so good about

00:15:13.040 --> 00:15:14.190
that kid's tofu?

00:15:14.690 --> 00:15:15.940
It's unbelievable.

00:15:16.090 --> 00:15:17.630
How could tofu cut itself like that?

00:15:17.870 --> 00:15:18.720
I don't understand.

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:20.830
After he poured the semi-finished tofu into the mold,

00:15:20.880 --> 00:15:21.850
he didn't touch it again.

00:15:22.110 --> 00:15:25.710
He was waiting for it to solidify until just now.

00:15:25.810 --> 00:15:26.800
But in the mold,

00:15:26.850 --> 00:15:29.580
a tofu dish had already been made.

00:15:30.500 --> 00:15:32.360
Is that mold a magical chest?

00:15:34.630 --> 00:15:37.400
Well, judges, please start to taste dishes now.

00:15:40.840 --> 00:15:41.940
Which dish should I eat first?

00:15:42.060 --> 00:15:43.950
I'm curious about Mao's dish.

00:15:44.030 --> 00:15:44.730
OK.

00:15:48.970 --> 00:15:49.920
Since it's black and white,

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:51.180
I think it has two tastes.

00:15:51.870 --> 00:15:54.140
Well, I'm gonna taste the white tofu first.

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:56.570
It looks novel,

00:15:56.730 --> 00:15:58.220
but that doesn't mean it tastes good.

00:15:58.430 --> 00:15:59.910
Mapo Tofu needs to be hot.

00:16:00.050 --> 00:16:01.700
(Hot)
In other words, the key is

00:16:01.750 --> 00:16:03.160
(Hot)
the extreme hotness.

00:16:04.720 --> 00:16:06.440
He had no time to heat the tofu.

00:16:06.490 --> 00:16:07.660
How can the cold

00:16:07.790 --> 00:16:09.090
Mapo Tofu be delicious?

00:16:10.720 --> 00:16:11.660
It's so hot.

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:13.910
What?

00:16:14.260 --> 00:16:16.520
There is no doubt that

00:16:16.560 --> 00:16:18.550
the extremely delicate tofu is hot enough.

00:16:18.650 --> 00:16:20.470
Next, I'm gonna try the black tofu.

00:16:27.180 --> 00:16:29.240
I can't believe that it's sweet tofu.

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:31.370
Besides the sweetness,

00:16:31.780 --> 00:16:32.560
it has a

00:16:32.610 --> 00:16:33.970
profound, fragrant and smooth flavor.

00:16:34.390 --> 00:16:36.440
Sweet tofu? No way.

00:16:36.770 --> 00:16:38.900
I added the black sugar to the black tofu.

00:16:40.330 --> 00:16:42.400
I only used the fragrant black beans

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:44.810
and the black sugar

00:16:44.990 --> 00:16:46.820
to make this special sweet black tofu.

00:16:46.990 --> 00:16:47.820
I got it.

00:16:48.210 --> 00:16:49.140
You used

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:51.110
the panda's favorite sugar.

00:16:53.300 --> 00:16:54.960
Well, what does the sauce taste?

00:16:56.190 --> 00:16:57.910
It's so spicy!

00:16:58.180 --> 00:17:00.280
I didn't know that the real Sichuan Mapo sauce

00:17:00.390 --> 00:17:01.740
is so spicy like that.

00:17:01.970 --> 00:17:03.060
You're so stupid.

00:17:03.510 --> 00:17:04.920
It's called Mapo Tofu

00:17:04.970 --> 00:17:06.160
so you need to eat the sauce with the tofu.

00:17:06.430 --> 00:17:07.230
Am I right?

00:17:07.800 --> 00:17:08.360
Yes.

00:17:12.980 --> 00:17:13.910
Delicious.

00:17:21.070 --> 00:17:21.670
It's so delicious.

00:17:26.000 --> 00:17:26.520
Guys, look!

00:17:27.790 --> 00:17:28.590
Look.

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:30.240
The happy sweat of judges

00:17:30.280 --> 00:17:33.160
flows constantly like the waterfall.

00:17:37.400 --> 00:17:39.230
The feeling that the chili stimulates the tongue.

00:17:39.390 --> 00:17:41.140
(Spiciness)
The spiciness as hot as the fire.

00:17:41.590 --> 00:17:44.080
(Numbness) The numbness from the sansho pepper
which can numb your taste suddenly.

00:17:44.430 --> 00:17:46.290
Then use the best white tofu to neutralize them.

00:17:46.350 --> 00:17:50.180
In the end, use the heavy sweetness of the black tofu

00:17:50.310 --> 00:17:51.490
to bring out all the unspeakable spiciness

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:53.310
of Mapo Tofu.

00:17:53.450 --> 00:17:54.810
From red to white.

00:17:54.910 --> 00:17:56.030
Then from white to black.

00:17:56.500 --> 00:17:57.950
Red, white, black.

00:17:58.050 --> 00:18:00.420
Then red, white, black again.

00:18:00.610 --> 00:18:01.960
The flavor offensive repeats again and again.

00:18:04.030 --> 00:18:06.880
The Magical Panda Mapo Tofu is so great.

00:18:14.540 --> 00:18:15.910
He succeeded again.

00:18:16.480 --> 00:18:17.210
I didn't expect that Mao

00:18:17.300 --> 00:18:19.830
can turn the tide.

00:18:20.180 --> 00:18:21.150
We won.

00:18:21.230 --> 00:18:24.100
My teacher has won all the competitions.

00:18:24.190 --> 00:18:26.070
My father will be saved. He'll be saved.

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:34.240
I feel like it was created by the magic.

00:18:34.650 --> 00:18:36.500
This dish has too many mysteries.

00:18:36.990 --> 00:18:37.970
Tell us, Mao.

00:18:38.390 --> 00:18:39.490
First, how did you

00:18:39.540 --> 00:18:40.740
make the soft semi-finished tofu

00:18:40.870 --> 00:18:42.660
(Black and White)
turn black and white like that?

00:18:43.240 --> 00:18:44.290
And

00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:45.330
how did you

00:18:45.380 --> 00:18:47.020
(Automatic Cut)
make it cut itself into cubes automatically?

00:18:47.360 --> 00:18:47.980
And

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:50.030
(Mold)
why is the tofu you took out of the mold

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:51.730
(Hot)
just now hot?

00:18:51.860 --> 00:18:52.880
The answers to your questions

00:18:52.950 --> 00:18:54.330
are all in this mold.

00:18:55.390 --> 00:18:56.240
That is...

00:18:56.590 --> 00:18:58.130
Its bottom is empty.

00:18:58.370 --> 00:19:00.010
And there is a net which is made of the threads.

00:19:02.010 --> 00:19:02.630
In order to

00:19:02.680 --> 00:19:04.300
shorten the cooking time,

00:19:04.530 --> 00:19:06.670
I specially made this hollow mold.

00:19:07.050 --> 00:19:07.570
First,

00:19:07.720 --> 00:19:10.300
put a lard board on the net

00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:11.260
you see.

00:19:11.520 --> 00:19:13.060
Then pour the semi-finished black tofu into the mold.

00:19:13.290 --> 00:19:14.930
Put a lard board on the black tofu.

00:19:14.980 --> 00:19:17.460
Then pour the semi-finished white tofu into the mold.

00:19:17.700 --> 00:19:19.580
Lard board. Semi-finished black tofu.

00:19:19.870 --> 00:19:21.810
Lard board. Semi-finished white tofu.

00:19:21.850 --> 00:19:22.880
Pile repeatedly like that.

00:19:23.980 --> 00:19:24.800
I got it.

00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:25.750
It's the lard board.

00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:26.960
When 80% of

00:19:27.010 --> 00:19:28.450
the tofu is solidified,

00:19:28.840 --> 00:19:31.600
put burning charcoals at the bottom of the mold.

00:19:32.070 --> 00:19:33.800
This mold will turn into a steamer directly.

00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:35.470
At this moment, the lard board which has been
used as a baffle

00:19:35.510 --> 00:19:36.540
will melt because of being heated.

00:19:36.690 --> 00:19:38.440
All of the lard will penetrate into the tofu.

00:19:39.330 --> 00:19:40.240
I got it.

00:19:40.390 --> 00:19:42.030
No wonder the tofu has been heated completely

00:19:42.190 --> 00:19:44.420
when it is ready.

00:19:44.760 --> 00:19:45.170
Yes.

00:19:45.270 --> 00:19:46.040
Then put the plate

00:19:46.090 --> 00:19:47.900
under the bottom of the mold.

00:19:48.430 --> 00:19:49.750
When I pull up the mold,

00:19:50.020 --> 00:19:51.530
the threads will

00:19:51.580 --> 00:19:53.280
cut all the tofu into small cubes.

00:19:53.520 --> 00:19:54.220
Finally,

00:19:54.450 --> 00:19:56.750
take away the bamboo leaves on the plate.

00:19:57.020 --> 00:19:58.990
Then the tofu can be combined with
the pre-prepared Mapo sauce.

00:19:59.240 --> 00:20:00.230
That's it.

00:20:05.650 --> 00:20:06.370
After listening to what you said,

00:20:06.420 --> 00:20:08.290
I feel like it's not that magical.

00:20:08.690 --> 00:20:11.240
How could you think of such an interesting idea?

00:20:11.340 --> 00:20:12.200
It's thanks to a lady.

00:20:12.250 --> 00:20:14.180
She brought me inspiration.

00:20:15.330 --> 00:20:17.430
That lady is so kind.

00:20:27.020 --> 00:20:28.050
What's this?

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:30.510
It's a special Japanese fermented food.

00:20:30.770 --> 00:20:31.470
It's called natto.

00:20:32.140 --> 00:20:34.040
Because of the fiber of the natto,

00:20:34.310 --> 00:20:35.010
I thought

00:20:35.070 --> 00:20:36.860
I could use threads to cut the tofu at a time.

00:20:37.570 --> 00:20:38.310
Cutting the tofu with threads

00:20:38.480 --> 00:20:39.240
can also accelerate Mapo sauce's

00:20:39.280 --> 00:20:40.380
penetration of tofu.

00:20:40.620 --> 00:20:42.650
It's an ideal cutting method which can create

00:20:43.040 --> 00:20:44.480
moderate fluctuations.

00:20:44.870 --> 00:20:45.610
Right.

00:20:46.010 --> 00:20:47.120
It has the same reason

00:20:47.170 --> 00:20:48.440
as Shaoan's bamboo kitchen knife.

00:20:50.470 --> 00:20:51.960
Besides, the hay bacilli

00:20:52.010 --> 00:20:53.680
has given me a lesson.

00:20:53.990 --> 00:20:55.700
This time in order to prevent the same thing
from happening again,

00:20:55.930 --> 00:20:58.670
I decided to use bamboo leaves
which have the germicidal function.

00:20:59.200 --> 00:21:00.560
When talking about bamboo leaves, think of the panda.

00:21:01.000 --> 00:21:03.490
When talking about the panda,
I think of my hometown Sichuan.

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:05.450
When talking about tofu dishes of Sichuan,

00:21:05.590 --> 00:21:07.600
I think of the Mapo Tofu.

00:21:09.690 --> 00:21:10.940
Crap.

00:21:11.390 --> 00:21:12.070
He's amazing.

00:21:12.850 --> 00:21:14.230
You're much better than I thought, kid.

00:21:14.510 --> 00:21:15.880
This dish really can be

00:21:15.930 --> 00:21:17.490
the main course of the banquet cuisine.

00:21:17.610 --> 00:21:18.920
It's the best outstanding dish.

00:21:20.030 --> 00:21:21.010
Great!

00:21:21.060 --> 00:21:21.740
Good!

00:21:21.820 --> 00:21:22.850
Hurrah!

00:21:22.900 --> 00:21:24.440
Hurrah for the natto!

00:21:32.810 --> 00:21:34.280
That's all your ability?

00:21:34.830 --> 00:21:36.370
I'll win this competition

00:21:36.830 --> 00:21:39.060
by using my Tofu Trio.

00:23:16.019 --> 00:23:18.021
Preview of the next episode

00:23:18.373 --> 00:23:22.750
What? Shaoan's Tofu Trio has Mom's big secret?

00:23:22.750 --> 00:23:24.355
What the hell is going on?

00:23:24.957 --> 00:23:27.900
At that moment, the Rou Rin Kan
exploded in a huge explosion.

00:23:28.483 --> 00:23:30.102
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:30.264 --> 00:23:31.494
Shocking Verdict!

00:23:31.791 --> 00:23:33.032
In the Palm of Chef Pai

00:23:33.352 --> 00:23:34.514
It will definitely be interesting!
